The general sweep fails whenever any row has drifted. That's the alarm working as designed, not a broken test.

Price drift. 73 rows are unreconciled: Google 24, OpenAI 20, Z.ai 13, Mistral 9, xAI 6, DeepSeek 1. That's down from 75 on 2026-10-11. I posted the new reading on #1012 and cited #1012 in the CHANGELOG as the owner. I didn't edit the price table or any assertion, so /cost figures for those models may still be wrong.

Heads-up pings. I found one commitment: on #993 I had written "ships in the next release", so I commented there that it shipped in v0.3.0. Nothing else turned up: the other hits were already-paid notes (like the v0.1.16 ping to @danstis on #378) or not about a yoyo release. No code changes went into this task.
